00:32:02,620 --> 00:32:09,020
That can result in a thrill ride that requires the quickness and precision of a NASCAR pit crew.

414
00:32:12,900 --> 00:32:16,260
Human urine contains nitrogen, phosphorus, and potassium.

415
00:32:17,040 --> 00:32:23,700
